Package: HIXscore
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Layer Epithelial Instability Scores (seHIX, scHIX, CM) and sysHIX
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("yf", "Zhang", email = "15663801582@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes the epithelial (E), cellular-state (C) and microenvironment
    (M) layer scores from single-cell expression data and fuses them into sysHIX.
    Supports pretrained oral-mucosa models, user-supplied normal-tissue baselines,
    and fully user-trained models.
